        "text_7aErDz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Raw denim is denim in its purest form untreated and unwashed- allowing it to develop a completely personal fade over time. 440 indicates the weight of our denim which is equivalent to a heavy denim. The denim is designed to evolve uniquely with every wear. The fabric is stiff when new and later softens over time with each wear. Expect natural fading over time. The pleating is well thought out to create a flattering drape. In the 440 weight the pleating of the denim is very distinct, holding its structure.</p>"
